{"seq":7,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:08:57.926Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"d261d245e5a01b77bc8234a0d6585a3a20d56782a94507c0e0e50eb0ad6d8714","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's digests show. They mostly describe owners as \"Gideon's account\" or \"Nadia's account\" rather than naming the owner outright, so some of this is inference.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until the 5/4/26 digest, which says it was reassigned in the CRM effective **2026-05-04**. The 4/27 digest and a Jul 1 #strategic-pod thread still call it Nadia's old account, and the 8/3 digest calls it \"Gideon's biggest account\". The 5/4 digest doesn't name the new owner for Vantorre Group. I'm inferring Gideon from the later digests.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The digests have called it his fleet account since 2025, and the 5/4/26 digest says he assumed management of it that day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, probably. It was Nadia's medical account in March 2025. The December 2025 and 9/30/26 digests refer to \"Gideon's medical account\". I couldn't find a handover date, and the 9/30 digest doesn't clearly tie that line to Orlavine.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** Nadia Fennimore, probably. In the 9/30 digest she volunteered to host the QFO training, and she is the one fielding QFO requests in #strategic-random. No digest states the owner outright.\n\nI'd confirm Orlavine and Quillfeather against the CRM before they go on the slide. The Vantorre Group date of 5/4/26 is the one I'm confident in."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
